# Training artifacts. Checkpoints are ~26 MB each and one generation produces
# dozens, so they are kept on disk and out of git — 194 of them had put 4.5 GB
# of blobs into unpushed history. The deployed policy reaches SpireBot as an
# ONNX export (above), not as a .pt.
runs/*.pt
runs/distill
# Per-iteration training logs (train_torch.csv_path) and eval sidecars —
# bulky, regenerable, one row per iteration of every run ever trained.
runs/run_logs/
